  "id": "cafeteria-style-dinner-rolls",
  "name": "Cafeteria-Style Dinner Rolls",
  "subtitle": "Soft, lightly sweet yeast rolls for a crowd",
  "description": "These tender rolls use a brief yeast rest, a buttery knead, and a chilled second rise before baking.",
